.TH LINUX-CONTAINER-ACCEPTANCE 1 "October 2026" "SASD Freeware M8.5.3" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
linux-container-acceptance \- record opt-in container test evidence for Linux distributions
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B linux-container-acceptance
.RB [ --run ]
.RB [ --engine " docker|podman" ]
.RB [ --target " distro" ]...
.RB [ --image " distro=repository@sha256:digest" ]...
.RB [ --format " tsv|jsonl" ]
.RB [ --require-complete ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Default PLAN mode never contacts a container daemon and emits SKIP records.
Only explicit --run enables local, pre-cached digest-pinned container checks.
Five independent stages: IDENTITY, TOOLCHAIN, TEST, INSTALL, and SMOKE.
A matching ID is not proof of kernel or host security compatibility.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B --run
Explicitly enable container execution. Requires --engine.
.TP
.BI --engine " docker|podman"
Select container engine; only fixed trusted executable paths are accepted.
.TP
.BI --target " distro"
Select one or more of debian, ubuntu, arch, almalinux, rocky.
.TP
.BI --image " distro=reference@sha256:hex"
Select locally cached immutable image; does not pull or build images.
.TP
.BI --format " tsv|jsonl"
Print five-field TSV (default) or JSON Lines.
.TP
.B --require-complete
Exit 4 if any test is skipped.
.TP
.B --help
Print usage.
.TP
.B --version
Print version.
.SH SECURITY
Source mount read-only; network disabled; no capabilities; no new privileges;
UID/GID 65534; container read-only root and temporary /tmp; bounded resources
and execution time. Docker daemon access may itself be privileged.
The tool never invokes sudo, downloads images, or changes host configuration.
After a timeout verify daemon-side cleanup manually.
.SH EXIT STATUS
.TP
.B 0
No FAIL; SKIPs allowed unless --require-complete.
.TP
.B 1
At least one FAIL.
.TP
.B 2
Invalid options.
.TP
.B 4
Skipped checks and --require-complete requested.
.SH LIMITATIONS
No native firewall, SELinux, AppArmor, systemd, package-manager, VM,
or production readiness certification.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR linux-distro-matrix (1),
.BR linux-platform-report (1)
